    {
      "filePath": "\/usr\/local\/place\/sandbox-data\/tasks\/7\/6\/4688764867\/service_resources\/ARC_TASKLETS_SIDECAR_BINARY\/mount\/mount-094d3ef6-9692-4a79-886a-be284e9b2745\/mobile\/fintech-sdk\/ios\/FintechSDK\/Scenarios\/AppTransportSecurity\/FTAppTransportSecurityScenario.swift",
      "kind": "StringLiteral",
      "offset": 6236,
      "length": 99,
      "value": "\"YandexPaySDK: в Info.plist не настроены ATS-исключения для хостов:\""
    },
    {
      "filePath": "\/usr\/local\/place\/sandbox-data\/tasks\/7\/6\/4688764867\/service_resources\/ARC_TASKLETS_SIDECAR_BINARY\/mount\/mount-094d3ef6-9692-4a79-886a-be284e9b2745\/mobile\/fintech-sdk\/ios\/FintechSDK\/Scenarios\/AppTransportSecurity\/FTAppTransportSecurityScenario.swift",
      "kind": "StringLiteral",
      "offset": 6372,
      "length": 158,
      "value": "\"Из-за этого обработчики сертификатов НУЦ и Яндекса не смогут обработать TLS-челленджи.\""
    },
    {
      "filePath": "\/usr\/local\/place\/sandbox-data\/tasks\/7\/6\/4688764867\/service_resources\/ARC_TASKLETS_SIDECAR_BINARY\/mount\/mount-094d3ef6-9692-4a79-886a-be284e9b2745\/mobile\/fintech-sdk\/ios\/FintechSDK\/Scenarios\/AppTransportSecurity\/FTAppTransportSecurityScenario.swift",
      "kind": "StringLiteral",
      "offset": 6591,
      "length": 89,
      "value": "\"Добавьте в Info.plist доменные исключения. Например:\""
    },
    {
      "filePath": "\/usr\/local\/place\/sandbox-data\/tasks\/7\/6\/4688764867\/service_resources\/ARC_TASKLETS_SIDECAR_BINARY\/mount\/mount-094d3ef6-9692-4a79-886a-be284e9b2745\/mobile\/fintech-sdk\/ios\/FintechSDK\/Scenarios\/AppTransportSecurity\/FTAppTransportSecurityScenario.swift",
      "kind": "StringLiteral",
      "offset": 6733,
      "length": 522,
      "value": "\"<key>NSAppTransportSecurity<\/key>\n<dict><key>NSExceptionDomains<\/key><dict>\n  <key>yandex.ru<\/key>\n  <dict><key>NSExceptionAllowsInsecureHTTPLoads<\/key><true\/><key>NSIncludesSubdomains<\/key><true\/><\/dict>\n  <key>ya.ru<\/key>\n  <dict><key>NSExceptionAllowsInsecureHTTPLoads<\/key><true\/><key>NSIncludesSubdomains<\/key><true\/><\/dict>\n  <key>yandex.net<\/key>\n  <dict><key>NSExceptionAllowsInsecureHTTPLoads<\/key><true\/><key>NSIncludesSubdomains<\/key><true\/><\/dict>\n<\/dict><\/dict>\""
    },
    {
      "filePath": "\/usr\/local\/place\/sandbox-data\/tasks\/7\/6\/4688764867\/service_resources\/ARC_TASKLETS_SIDECAR_BINARY\/mount\/mount-094d3ef6-9692-4a79-886a-be284e9b2745\/mobile\/fintech-sdk\/ios\/FintechSDK\/Scenarios\/AppTransportSecurity\/FTAppTransportSecurityScenario.swift",
      "kind": "StringLiteral",
      "offset": 7314,
      "length": 130,
      "value": "\"Также можно включить эффективный NSAllowsArbitraryLoads = YES без fine-grained ATS-ключей.\""
    },
    {
      "filePath": "\/usr\/local\/place\/sandbox-data\/tasks\/7\/6\/4688764867\/service_resources\/ARC_TASKLETS_SIDECAR_BINARY\/mount\/mount-094d3ef6-9692-4a79-886a-be284e9b2745\/mobile\/fintech-sdk\/ios\/FintechSDK\/Scenarios\/AppTransportSecurity\/Validation\/FTAppTransportSecurityExceptionDomain.swift",
